# Citation metadata for this repository. GitHub shows it under "Cite this repository".
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository or the S1-Tweaks v0.1 or S1-Router v0.1 heads, please cite it with
  the metadata below. Please also cite Contrastive Language Models (CLM), which this work builds
  on. It is the first entry under references.
title: "System One Model Tweaks"
abstract: >-
  Measured tweaks to the CLM-8B System One decision model. Two released heads derived from the
  CLM-v0.1-8B weights: S1-Router v0.1 (further post-training on listwise choice data) and
  S1-Tweaks v0.1 (a weight blend of CLM's head and S1-Router). Plus experiments on backbone and
  head quantization, head layouts and backbone swaps. Every number comes with the result file it
  was read from and with its limits.
type: software
